# `locales/en/apgames.json` is merge output

Do **not** add or change user-visible English strings only in `locales/en/apgames.json`. CI (`check-apgames-en`) rejects commits where the file differs from merge sources.

**Author English here instead:**

- Shared copy: `locale-src/en/apgames/shared/**`
- Per game: `gameinfo` + `export const gameApgamesEn` in `src/games/<uid>.ts`

Then run `npm run merge-apgames-en` and commit the regenerated `locales/en/apgames.json`.

`locales/en/apresults.json` is still edited directly. Other languages under `locales/{de,fr,it,es-US}/` are Weblate/CI-managed — do not hand-edit `locale-src/{de,fr,it,es-US}/` tracking files.

Details: [docs/i18n.md](docs/i18n.md), [locales/en/README.md](locales/en/README.md).
